Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.31,0:00:06.48,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,You seem awfully composed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:10.23,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Of course I do. We still have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.81,0:00:13.49,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,What did you expect me to do? Give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.97,0:00:16.99,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Now, if you're done making small talk, \Nget back to work,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.33,0:00:18.97,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,you slow coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.49,0:00:24.36,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,Whoops. Silly me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.13,0:00:26.54,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:28.58,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,Why, what have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.64,0:00:34.23,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,It looks like plans \Nfor the renovation of city hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:35.38,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Renovation?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.05,0:00:42.11,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,Yes. A lightning strike caused a fire \Njust before your execution, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.11,0:00:44.25,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,Oh, I beg your pardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:45.85,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.85,0:00:49.19,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I don't remember the day of my execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.19,0:00:50.86,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:53.02,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,No, not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:55.86,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Wait. That's not quite true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.97,0:01:05.37,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I recall an executioner gave me a fruit \Ndrink before they shackled my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:10.87,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.87,0:01:13.85,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I don't remember a thing \Nafter that drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.85,0:01:18.74,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,Before your execution, they must've given\N you that sedative that calms your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.74,0:01:21.38,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,It's made from a rare fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.95,0:01:27.89,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,Tales tell of crossing the flow of time \Nfor those who consume it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.23,0:01:29.75,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,The flow of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.27,0:01:32.14,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,Oh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:36.62,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,A tunnel under Saint Mark's Square?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.62,0:01:40.03,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,What a perfect place to conceal hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.03,0:01:44.08,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I'm impressed. Alert the Royal \NSecurity Force at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:46.79,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,My lady's wish is my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.79,0:01:48.11,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:52.65,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,This time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:59.71,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I really will show them all that I shall\N be the one with the last laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:43.59,Default,Enrique,0,0,0,,What's this? Have you\N come to finish me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:48.56,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,If I really wanted to kill you, \Nyou'd be dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.01,0:03:50.60,Default,Enrique,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:53.62,Default,Enrique,0,0,0,,I was dreaming...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:59.62,Default,Enrique,0,0,0,,Remember I slipped out of the palace to\Nsee popular street performers in the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.23,0:04:04.00,Default,Enrique,0,0,0,,A boy picked my pocket on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:10.27,Default,Enrique,0,0,0,,But you caught him right away, \Nand you said to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:16.76,Flashback,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Whatever your reasons, you should never \Nlive a life you can't be proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:20.96,Default,Enrique,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe \Nhow upstanding you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:23.01,Default,Enrique,0,0,0,,Was that all an act too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.26,0:04:26.03,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Of course it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:28.53,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,I was just parroting Cess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:30.04,Default,Enrique,0,0,0,,Cess?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:32.50,Flashback - Italics,Cess,0,0,0,,Cici!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:42.42,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,You know, Enrique, I've always \Ndespised how careless you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:44.93,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:49.44,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,just for today, I'll commend you for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.89,0:04:51.43,Default,Enrique,0,0,0,,Cecilia?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.11,0:04:58.57,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:05.55,Default,Krishna,0,0,0,,Why, Crown Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:10.08,Default,Krishna,0,0,0,,I heard a commotion at the royal villa. \NIs something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:12.83,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,As it happens, the crown prince is unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:17.08,Default,Krishna,0,0,0,,The execution is today. \NWe don't want him dying on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:20.44,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Don't worry. \NI think it's just one of his fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:23.36,Default,Krishna,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.15,0:05:34.34,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.13,0:05:37.58,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:39.73,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,Merely a fruit drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:42.96,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Lord Hamsworth?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:45.99,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,The church has prepared \Nthis for you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:48.90,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,I've received permission to bear witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:50.62,Default,Guard A,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:55.36,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,A certain lady told me to see that\Nyou don't take any strange drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:57.36,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,A certain lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:10.13,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,I've been told to move the hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.46,0:06:12.35,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Didn't they notify you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:14.34,Default,Lookout A,0,0,0,,No, I haven't heard anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.80,0:06:16.39,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.74,0:06:23.30,Main - Italics,Cecilia {M},0,0,0,,One down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:33.25,Main - Italics,Cecilia {M},0,0,0,,Two down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.47,0:06:39.17,Default,Lucia,0,0,0,,Your Royal Highness...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:53.79,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Go straight down the righthand tunnel, \Nand you'll find an exit to the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.69,0:06:57.27,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.88,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:01.33,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:12.15,Default,Krishna,0,0,0,,What are you playing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:16.92,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,I couldn't help it, could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:18.04,Default,Krishna,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:21.44,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,As I said, I couldn't help it. \NThere's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.89,0:07:24.54,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,We were bound to lose from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:27.55,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Indeed, that woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:29.55,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Scarlett Castiel...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:32.58,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,changed fate completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:35.92,Default,Krishna,0,0,0,,Where is the prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.53,0:07:41.79,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Who the hell would tell \Na scumbag like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.55,0:07:45.57,Default,Krishna,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:50.90,Main - Italics,Cecilia {M},0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:53.21,Main - Italics,Cecilia {M},0,0,0,,it's finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:55.65,Main - Italics,Cecilia {M},0,0,0,,Right, Cess?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:08:01.10,Main - Italics,Cecilia {M},0,0,0,,Did I manage... to do \Nthe right thing in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.72,0:08:06.92,Flashback - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,Whose voice did you want to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:10.66,Main - Italics,Cecilia {M},0,0,0,,I guess even I've lost my edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.98,0:08:14.67,Default,Cess,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:17.78,Default,Cess,0,0,0,,That's my Cici!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:22.17,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Cess...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:28.82,Default,Cess,0,0,0,,Cici.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.10,0:08:31.14,Default,Cess,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.31,0:08:33.78,Main - Italics,Cecilia {M},0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.33,Main - Italics,Cecilia {M},0,0,0,,I can hear her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:39.48,Main - Italics,Cecilia {M},0,0,0,,She was there all along... \Nif I'd listened hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.16,0:08:49.67,Default,Ulysses,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:51.33,Default,Lucia,0,0,0,,I can see the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:54.08,Default,Lucia,0,0,0,,We're near Saint Mark's Square!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:57.84,Default,Ulysses,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:02.76,Default,Lucia,0,0,0,,You know her, Uly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.76,0:09:03.65,Default,Ulysses,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.07,0:09:09.95,Default,Krishna,0,0,0,,We're pulling out. Find the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:12.06,Default,Kyle,0,0,0,,Hi there...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.09,0:09:15.61,Default,Kyle,0,0,0,,Assistant Comptroller May.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.94,0:09:18.60,Default,Krishna,0,0,0,,What are {\i1}you{\i0} doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:21.75,Default,Kyle,0,0,0,,You could say the goddesses led us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:24.99,Default,Kyle,0,0,0,,Though their guidance came \Nby way of an old pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.49,0:09:29.51,Default,Kyle,0,0,0,,Now, I'll give you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.77,0:09:32.75,Default,Kyle,0,0,0,,Die now or die later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.06,0:09:36.25,Default,Kyle,0,0,0,,'Course, you're a dead man either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.98,0:09:44.69,Default,Aldous,0,0,0,,We're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.69,0:09:46.02,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,Constance...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:58.32,Main - Italics,Connie {M},0,0,0,,It's just like ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.32,0:09:59.69,Default,Crowd A,0,0,0,,Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.69,0:10:01.05,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,You demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.05,0:10:02.65,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Have you no shame?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:05.17,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,Stop that racket!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:08.41,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,Honestly, what's wrong with you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:11.04,Default,Audrey,0,0,0,,And people wonder \Nwhy I loathe little brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.30,0:10:14.39,Default,Miriam,0,0,0,,Really, Audrey. Such a foul mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.39,0:10:16.25,Default,Rebekah,0,0,0,,Don't be silly, Miriam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:18.79,Default,Rebekah,0,0,0,,Audrey has bad hearing \N{\i1}and{\i0} a bad attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:22.33,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Constance Grail is innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:26.56,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Please! Please stop the execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.19,0:10:28.55,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Kate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.86,0:10:34.92,Default,Mylene,0,0,0,,We have testimony from a girl \Nwho was in Pamela Francis's entourage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:37.19,Default,Mylene,0,0,0,,Here! Go on and read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.57,0:10:38.98,Main - Italics,Connie {M},0,0,0,,Mylene...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.70,0:10:50.06,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Please listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:51.17,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I'm—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:57.52,Default,Gaina,0,0,0,,Constance Grail!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.71,0:11:03.59,Default,Gaina,0,0,0,,For the crimes of abducting a foreign \Nprince and plotting insurrection,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.59,0:11:06.03,Default,Gaina,0,0,0,,you will hereby be beheaded by the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:21.12,Main - Italics,Connie {M},0,0,0,,I won't regret a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.13,0:11:27.63,Main - Italics,Connie {M},0,0,0,,I refuse to!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.77,0:11:37.12,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.97,0:11:46.39,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Your Lordship...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.55,0:11:51.66,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,This execution is null and void!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.66,0:11:53.50,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,The prince is right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.77,0:12:04.41,Default,Ulysses,0,0,0,,I am Ulysses Faris, seventh prince \Nof the Kingdom of Faris.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:07.84,Default,Ulysses,0,0,0,,My abductors hailed from \Nmy homeland of Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:10.41,Default,Ulysses,0,0,0,,That woman had nothing to do with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:14.43,Default,Gaina,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:19.93,Default,Gaina,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are! \NWhat's to show you're the real prince?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.65,0:12:29.69,Default,Kendall,0,0,0,,Who stands before you is none other than \NHis Royal Highness Prince Ulysses!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.93,0:12:31.23,Default,Ulysses,0,0,0,,Kendall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:32.68,Default,San,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.34,0:12:38.17,Default,Kendall,0,0,0,,I drove my old bones hard \Nto make it on horseback.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.17,0:12:39.19,Default,Kendall,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:43.32,Default,Kendall,0,0,0,,This is a record of the \Nrecent council's decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.63,0:12:46.31,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you pushed it \Nthrough so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:49.82,Default,Kendall,0,0,0,,Prince Theophilis put in \Na word on our behalf,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.82,0:12:53.80,Default,Kendall,0,0,0,,but I believe King Ernst's visit \Nwas the deciding factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:58.71,Default,Kendall,0,0,0,,Given that he came at the behest \Nof the "captive" third princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:02.59,Default,Kendall,0,0,0,,guilty parties doubtless feared
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.75,0:13:04.22,Signs,Signs,0,0,0,,SECOND PRINCE OF FARIS\NRODERICK
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:07.09,Default,Kendall,0,0,0,,that you already had \Nan alliance with Adelbide.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:11.10,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'll have to thank Allie \Nfor standing in for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:15.61,Default,Kendall,0,0,0,,Yes. Now, the temple has \Ngiven its approval as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.11,0:13:19.18,Default,Kendall,0,0,0,,You need only add your own signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.21,0:13:21.49,Default,San,0,0,0,,Will this do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:27.12,Default,Kendall,0,0,0,,Allow me to reiterate my delight that \NYour Royal Highnesses are both unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:29.36,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Royal... Highness{\i1}es{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:30.81,Default,San,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.12,0:13:38.62,Default,San,0,0,0,,I am Alexandra Faris, \Nlegitimate heir to the throne of Faris,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:41.89,Default,San,0,0,0,,and, as of now, her new sovereign.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:46.14,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,N-New sovereign?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.15,0:13:50.35,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,You're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:52.14,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:56.96,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,You look a little red.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.96,0:13:58.49,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I... I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.49,0:14:00.62,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,L-Look, see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:04.28,Default,Gaina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her{\i0}, the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.15,0:14:08.12,Default,Gaina,0,0,0,,This can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.12,0:14:09.61,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:14.73,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,We know about your ties to Rufus May.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.73,0:14:16.75,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,He's already in custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:19.04,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:20.97,Default,Security Force A,0,0,0,,We're sealing off the square!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:22.85,Default,Security Force B,0,0,0,,There won't be any execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:25.06,Default,Gaina,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.06,0:14:27.36,Default,Gaina,0,0,0,,This wasn't supposed to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:29.31,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,I need you to let me restrain you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.81,0:14:40.36,Default,Gaina,0,0,0,,Don't think you've won!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:41.68,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Connie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.61,Default,Security Force A,0,0,0,,Hurry! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:01.82,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Connie...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:08.34,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Connie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:10.74,Main - Italics,Connie {M},0,0,0,,No! Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.42,0:15:13.34,Main - Italics,Connie {M},0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:16.60,Default,Connie {M},0,0,0,,Scarlett!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.47,0:15:26.75,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Remember well, Constance Grail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:32.35,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,A hero always enters fashionably late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:34.36,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Scarlett!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:39.13,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Honestly, look at all the trouble \Nyou've put me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:42.03,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,The nerve of you, Connie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.65,0:15:49.22,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Scarlett?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:58.90,Flashback,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,So I have no doubt that once you feel \Nyour revenge is complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.46,0:16:02.60,Flashback,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,you will return to the gods' side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.95,0:16:05.97,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:09.06,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:11.07,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Scarlett!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:16.32,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,What an awful face \Nyou're making, silly Connie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:19.32,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Really, girl, why do I put up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.44,0:16:22.87,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,You're not much to look at, you're timid,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.87,0:16:28.13,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,you can't keep a secret, \Nyou're silly, you're foolish,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:31.12,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,and you don't listen\N to a thing people tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:33.88,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,But you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.14,0:16:40.53,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I love you, Constance Grail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:48.66,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Scarlett!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:16:59.71,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:02.66,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:07.98,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,Did I dream all of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:12.02,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,If so, that future\N will never come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.06,0:17:16.08,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,It was all an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.07,0:17:19.82,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,I can't bear it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.86,0:17:24.70,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,For those days, those moments,\N to never be...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.70,0:17:26.06,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,Anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:29.82,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,I can't be executed like this\Nand have that be the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:36.95,Flashback - Italics,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,Tales tell of crossing the flow \Nof time for those who consume it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.21,0:17:38.45,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:43.30,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,Then I need only {\i0}make{\i1}\N that future a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.45,0:17:45.94,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,And to do so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:49.75,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:54.47,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,A curse on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:17:58.74,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,A curse on you. A curse on you,\N Scarlett Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:05.43,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,If it makes that dream the future, \Nif it makes those days truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.82,0:18:09.93,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,then abandon shame and reputation \Nand rise again as a vengeful ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:14.38,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,A curse upon you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:21.65,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,I have no idea whether this \Nis the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.65,0:18:22.78,Default,Man,0,0,0,,You fiend!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:25.02,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,Even so, I'm certain...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.65,0:18:26.73,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,I'm sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:29.96,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.75,0:18:36.25,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,It will be all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.11,0:18:38.78,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,There's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:40.68,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.89,0:18:45.17,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for you \Nat the Grand Merillian.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:53.38,Main - Italics,Scarlett {M},0,0,0,,I know that you'll find me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.11,0:19:01.32,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,Two months have flown by\N since you went away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:04.58,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,How have you been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:09.91,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,The succession dispute\N in Faris has been settled,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:14.27,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,and Alexandra made it through \Nher coronation without incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.73,0:19:19.43,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,With that, we've averted \Nthis war once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:24.44,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Crown Princess Cecilia \Nlost her life that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.07,0:19:29.70,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,It seems she fell to gunfire letting \NLucia and Prince Ulysses escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:33.62,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,Even more people have been arrested,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.10,0:19:37.94,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,including the mastermind, Rufus May, \Nand his highborn conspirators.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:41.48,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,Pamela's testimony was judged false,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:44.99,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,and she keeps attempting to escape the \Nhospital where she's getting treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:47.71,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.45,0:19:53.27,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,the events of ten years ago\Nhave now come to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:57.23,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(760,1)\fs10\fnArial\c&H351F51&\3c&H9985A7&\blur1\shad0\pos(487.153,268.32)}Translation:\N{\fs12}William Varteresian
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.79,0:19:56.72,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,I have good news on that front.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.98,0:20:02.38,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,Scarlett, they've finally \Ncleared your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.23,0:20:02.24,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(750,750)\fs8\fnArial\c&H351F51&\3c&H9985A7&\blur1\shad0\pos(158.57,116.765)}Subtitle Timing:\N{\fs10}Edgar Cruz\N\N\N{\fs8}Subtitle Editing:\N{\fs10}Riley Dalton
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:09.48,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,At the same time, they can hardly \Nmake public the whole truth of your case.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:08.49,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(500,750)\fs8\fnArial\c&H351F51&\3c&HA893B6&\blur1\shad0\pos(159.808,75.979)}Quality Check:\N{\fs10}SMR\N\N\N{\fs8}Translation Check:\N{\fs10}Sriram Gurunathan
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.19,0:20:18.05,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,A little embellishment has made \Nthe poisoning part of Daeg Gallus's plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.13,0:20:23.27,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,Both Mylene and Kate\N have started down their own paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:26.57,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,Lucia was safely reunited \Nwith Lady Abigail,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.57,0:20:30.40,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,and I hear she's started corresponding \Nwith Prince Ulysses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.70,0:20:38.37,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,Without Scarlett Castiel around, \Nmy days are quiet, peaceful, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:40.62,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,a little bit dull.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.30,0:20:44.93,Main - Italics,Connie {N},0,0,0,,So allow me to say one last thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.80,0:20:48.39,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Silly Scarlett.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.97,0:20:53.34,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Randolph.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.86,0:20:54.73,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.91,0:20:57.44,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I was only calling your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:21:00.21,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Only calling my name? Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.21,0:21:01.30,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:05.57,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Connie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.57,0:21:07.90,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Yes? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:09.65,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,I was only calling your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.48,0:21:26.00,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,Why, if it isn't Miss Grail.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.39,0:21:28.16,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Lord Hamsworth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:31.00,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Thank you for having me here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.37,0:21:35.02,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,No thanks necessary. \NWelcome to my exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.49,0:21:37.59,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.59,0:21:42.27,Default,Hamsworth,0,0,0,,Oh, something about \Na stray dog in the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.27,0:21:45.27,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,What are the guards doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:47.69,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,I'll go check on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:51.52,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,W-Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:53.91,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I-I'll go with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.92,0:21:57.16,Main - Italics,Connie {M},0,0,0,,Wait, he's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:04.61,Main - Top,Pamela,0,0,0,,It's your fault... All your fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.96,0:22:05.80,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,P-Pamela?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.10,0:22:07.79,Default,Pamela,0,0,0,,It's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.24,0:22:10.30,Default,Pamela,0,0,0,,If you were gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.87,0:22:12.43,Default,Pamela,0,0,0,,If only...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.68,0:22:15.94,Default,Pamela,0,0,0,,If only you were gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.85,0:22:22.96,Main - Italics,Connie {M},0,0,0,,Someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:25.19,Main - Italics,Connie {M},0,0,0,,Someone save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.06,0:22:28.24,Main - Italics,Connie {M},0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.69,0:22:30.02,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.20,0:22:33.04,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.95,0:22:44.72,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Clumsy as ever, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.55,0:22:52.09,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,But how...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.01,0:22:55.70,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Why, when I stopped to think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:59.60,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I realized I hadn't avenged \Nmyself on anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.11,0:23:04.22,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,The thought made me positively livid!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.22,0:23:09.36,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I saw a white light, but I turned back \Nto avenge myself properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.10,0:23:12.78,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,You can't be serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.23,0:23:18.61,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I saved you, so you've no right to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.48,0:23:22.23,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Listen well, Constance Grail.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.75,0:23:28.59,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,You will spend the rest of your life \Nensuring that I have my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.34,0:23:33.36,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Right.
